{
  "name": "f2. front-desk-book",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## f2 · Book (Sera's tool)\nSera calls this only after the patient said yes to the details. It runs the **same checks as the booking form**:\n1. **Check Time**: d0 confirms that exact time is free that exact day (no silent move to another day).\n2. **Shape**: all seven details present, one doctor, a real visit type.\n3. **Find Times** + **Final Check**: d0 validates name, mobile and email, then re-checks the slot at the last moment.\n4. **Save**, **confirm by email**, **log** in Request Log, exactly like d1.\n\nAnything wrong returns `not_booked` with a plain reason and free alternatives, and nothing is written.",
        "height": 290,
        "width": 700
      },
      "id": "ed0e6549-d698-4593-b3fe-a5a08047ffd2",
      "name": "Note: f2",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -40,
        -470
      ]
    },
